  "notes": [
    "This is an aggregate structural accounting checkpoint for the local ignored sidecar; it is not a promoted production artifact.",
    "The v11 dictionary adds reviewed Argentina retail abbreviations for oral care, pet food, hair color, hair care, cleaning, deodorant, air freshener, salt, spice and potato-chip queries, plus explicit bilingual aliases for generic family forms.",
